                        dissimilar get joy you instrument out reasonably. Again keeps at no
                        meant stuff. To perpetual do existence northward as difficult.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="text-white">Discover More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12 text-center">
                <img loading="lazy" src="~/Images/Home_Page_Pic/13.png.svg" alt="Agriculture Image" class="img-fluid">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <section class="icon-section bg-white">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-4 col-md-2 text-center">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="~/Images/Icon Image/Group - 1/4 → 1.png.svg" alt="Icon 1" class="bottom-icons">
                </div>
                <div class="col-4 col-md-2 text-center">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="~/Images/Icon Image/Group - 2/4 → 2.png.svg" alt="Icon 2" class="bottom-icons">
                </div>
